---
/** data-cloak: no flash of pre-hydration state. */
---

<section class="demo" data-signals="{open: false}">
  <h2>No flash of hidden content</h2>
  <button
    data-on:click="$open = !$open"
    data-text="$open ? 'Hide' : 'Show'"
  >
    Show
  </button>
  <p data-show="$open" data-cloak>
    This paragraph starts closed. Without <code>data-cloak</code> it would
    be visible for a moment on page load, before Datastar applies
    <code>data-show="$open"</code>.
  </p>
</section>
